{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reach","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"otherwise","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"refusal","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping ","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Rule","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4RuleV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rule"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The line shown when the closure says no. Defaults to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stock "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/cantReach"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"refusal"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The closure answering “can they touch it from here”.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"body"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The assembled reach rule.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContainersDoorsAndLocks","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["card.reach(otherwise: \"The card is squares away from you, across the sand.\") {","    grid.playerSquare == grid.cardSquare","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Containment is room-granular: a thing lying in one square of a floor the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"map models as a single room is “in the room” from every square, and so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reachable from every square. This is where a game says otherwise, once,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead of guarding ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"take"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"open"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"put in"},{"text":" one verb at a time.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It narrows reach and nothing else. The item stays ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"visible"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player can still name it, examine it and read about it in the room"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"description — which is what makes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"take"},{"type":"text","text":" answer “it’s across the sand”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than “you can’t see any such thing”."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two things the engine settles so the closure doesn’t have to. What the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asker is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"holding","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" always passes, so a rule keyed to a square can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stop the player opening a box they are carrying. And the rule is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consulted "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"before any ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"before"},{"text":" rule runs","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", so an item’s own rules never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fire for something out of reach."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Declared in a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"text":" block; a second ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reach"},{"text":" rule for the same entity is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a fatal bootstrap diagnostic. Locations don’t take one.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Containers, Doors, and Locks","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContainersDoorsAndLocks","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/lockedBy(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/startsUnlocked","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/isOpen","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/isLocked","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/isReachable","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/isReachable(from:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/isVisible","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/reveal()","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/isRevealed"],"anchor":"Containers-Doors-and-Locks"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/reach(otherwise:_:)"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"reach(otherwise:_:)","externalID":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV5reach9otherwise_AA4RuleVSSSg_SbyYbctF","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reach","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"otherwise","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"